<title>USA: Washington Twp., $2 mln won by Seasongood.</title>
<headline>Washington Twp., $2 mln won by Seasongood.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seasongood &amp; Mayer said it won $2 million of Washington Twp, Ohio, fire station facilities limited tax notes, with a net interest cost of 4.63 percent.</p>
